                                "example_id": "9fccba35-9852-444c-90a3-6494254d4cc6",
                                "sense_id": "69ad47a3-bf38-3da0-bb84-54e2806bb2ba",
                                "text": "Formally, a supergroup is a more general notion than group. We illustrate the difference between the two notions by a simple example."
